Fixed ``migrate`` reporting "Your models in app(s): 'auth' have changes that are not yet reflected in a migration" on every deploy. ``admin.py`` mutated ``help_text`` on the vendored ``auth.User.username`` field at import time; unlike the adjacent ``validators`` override, ``help_text`` is tracked by Django's migration autodetector, so the auth app looked permanently out of sync. The help text is now applied only at the form level (where it was already set), leaving the model field's migration state untouched.
